#    Use the key instead of the text (for example, as a plan name).
#    Prefix your keys with custom- to avoid conflicts with built-in keys.

# Keys must be unique. For detailed translation documentation, see assets/README.md.

# Maximum translation length:
# For use in buttons — 32 characters.
# For use in messages — 1024 characters.

